                  "notes": "Commercial food mixture - FOODON is correct parent ontology. Soy peptone is an enzymatic hydrolysate of soybean protein; mapped to FOODON parent 'vegetable protein, hydrolyzed'. No exact FOODON term for soy peptone. CLOSE_MATCH.",
